      "message": "test(app): regenerate the Haas inch goldens for the four-decimal feed\n\nprogram_units compares the Haas inch programs with committed goldens.\nThey held two-decimal in/min feeds (F19.69, F3.94, F2.36); the post now\nwrites four (F19.685, F3.937, F2.3622). Only F words changed, each by\n0.005 or less. The doc of same_program_in_inch and the decision file\nnow say this, and that the standalone post binary writes a refused\nprogram with its warning.\n\nRefs #3694\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
